            "source": [
                "## 8. Resume-capable fine-tuning\n",
                "\n",
                "Every checkpoint stores:\n",
                "\n",
                "- model weights\n",
                "- optimizer state\n",
                "- AMP scaler state\n",
                "- epoch\n",
                "- optimizer step\n",
                "- training configuration\n",
                "- loss history\n",
                "\n",
                "This keeps Phase 3 interruption-safe rather than trusting Kaggle's fragile relationship with time."
            ]
        },
        {
            "cell_type": "code",
            "execution_count": 14,
